agement assessment built to make AI transformation more measurable and actionable. You\u2019ll see how the free Business AI Score and Personal AI Score assessments reveal strengths and gaps, guide personalized learning plans, and shape your AI transformation roadmap. Register free for live and on-demand access at <a href=\"https://smarterx.ai/webinar-ai-score?hsLang=en\">SmarterX.ai</a></em></p><p>--</p><p><em>This episode is also brought to you by the MAICON 2026 On-Demand Bundle. Couldn\u2019t make it to Cleveland, or want to rewatch? </em></p><p><em>The MAICON 2026 On-Demand bundle gives you more than two dozen recorded main-stage and featured sessions (12+ hours) from this year\u2019s Marketing AI Conference, ready to watch on your own schedule. Grab it at MAICON.AI</em></p><p>--</p><p>Visit our <a href=\"https://podcast.smarterx.ai/?utm_source=podcast&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=podcast_description\">website</a></p><p>Receive our<a href=\"https://www.marketingaiinstitute.com/newsletter/?utm_source=podcast&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=podcast_description\"> weekly newsletter</a></p><p>Join our community:</p><p><a href=\"https://smarterx.ai/community/?utm_source=podcast&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=podcast_description\">Slack Community</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/smarterxai\">LinkedIn</a></p><p><a href=\"https://x.com/aishowpod\">Twitter</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/marketing.ai/\">Instagram</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/marketingAIinstitute\">Facebook</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@aishowpod?utm_source=podcast&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=podcast_description\">YouTube</a></p><p>Looking for content and resources?</p><p>Register for a<a href=\"https://www.marketingaiinstitute.com/resources#filter=.webinar/?utm_source=podcast&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=podcast_description\"> free webinar</a></p><p>Come to our next<a href=\"https://www.mar